     1→/**
     2→ * 5-Layer Video Fallback System for Android 11+
     3→ *
     4→ * Layer 1: Direct content:// URI — fastest (viewer feeds ExoPlayer directly)
     5→ * Layer 2: SAF → cacheDirectory copy — reliable (serialized queue, 2 attempts)
     6→ * Layer 3: SAF → documentDirectory copy — persists across cache clears
     7→ * Layer 4: Native Android Intent player — opens externally, OEM-safe
     8→ * Layer 5: MediaLibrary save → fresh content:// — nuclear last resort
     9→ *
    10→ * Layers 1+2 are handled inside MediaContext (prepareStatusForViewing).
    11→ * Layers 3–5 are provided here and called from viewer.tsx when 1+2 fail.
    12→ */
